{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-13","kind":"proposition","title":"邻补角：直线上形成的两角和为平角","englishTitle":"If a straight line set up on a straight line make angles, it will make either two right angles or angles equal to two right angles.","book":1,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","contentId":"euclid-1-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3afd5fd58aab462d78781e98516d8cd51d3bc05bfd893f449e9506f0ed8516e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-13.statement","euclid-1-13.construction.1","euclid-1-13.proof.1","euclid-1-13.proof.2","euclid-1-13.proof.3","euclid-1-13.proof.4","euclid-1-13.proof.5","euclid-1-13.proof.6","euclid-1-13.proof.7","euclid-1-13.conclusion","euclid-1-13.historical.1","euclid-1-13.historical.2","euclid-1-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b46777b33e6c434affe991f90e38aa2732240c79c2145e79690a10f16e198fe8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line set up on a straight line make angles, it will make either two right angles or angles equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线设置在直线上, 产生角度, 它会使两个 直角 或角度等于两个 直角 。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线至他直线上所作两角，非直角、即等于两直角。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线与另一条直线相交时形成的两个相邻角，要么都是直角，要么它们的和等于两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24c97c7c34de27d573a0132dec79348d5ae7f2ba6797ae054bf1b02310623fa3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let any straight line AB set up on the straight line CD make the angles CBA, ABD;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD线上的任何直线AB线线,以CBA、ABD为角;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e0b34f43e4589e852e25df4a1967ddbca0a28c062b2d2d176ef4630218602b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angles CBA, ABD are either two right angles or equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说CBA,ABD的角度是2 直角或者等于2 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c216a1562de2c31e329d2001998fee485dd6d8ee73bdeac5be9586215b2178f8","citations":["euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, if the angle CBA is equal to the angle ABD, they are two right angles. [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果角度CBA等于角度ABD, 它们是两个直角。 [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59d85c60e678079adfbe210ea997e54b0bbce87e810fd76f90549710af8ba483","citations":["euclid-1-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, let BE be drawn from the point B at right angles to CD; [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] therefore the angles CBE, EBD are two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,则从B点直角到CD点抽出BE;因此,CBE、EBD角度是2 直角。 [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7347b35d18442eff96b16add1b6006e0f4ffa5650426397c69711dbaa35aa43d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle CBE is equal to the two angles CBA, ABE, let the angle EBD be added to each; therefore the angles CBE, EBD are equal to the three angles CBA, ABE, EBD. [C. N. 2]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CBE角度等于两个角度 CBA,ABE,让每个角度增加EBD;CBE,EBD等于三个角度 CBA,ABE,EBD。 [C. N. 2]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c244f8a5b2c6809384575cef35573af314585f0c298153986118e476864b2778","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the angle DBA is equal to the two angles DBE, EBA, let the angle ABC be added to each; therefore the angles DBA. ABC are equal to the three angles DBE, EBA, ABC. [C. N. 2]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DBA角度等于两个角度DBE,EBA,让每个角度增加ABC;因此,DBA。 ABC等于三个角度DBE,EBA,ABC。 [C. N. 2]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"691685346aad18879e7b28704e79b441480ea27977c2fdd61f93c487860b7ac0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles CBE, EBD were also proved equal to the same three angles; and things which are equal to the same thing are also equal to one another; [C. N. 1] therefore the angles CBE, EBD are also equal to the angles DBA, ABC. But the angles CBE, EBD are two right angles; therefore the angles DBA, ABC are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CBE,EBD的角度也证明等于相同的三个角度;而等同于同一事物的东西也等于彼此;[C,N.1] 因此,CBE,EBD的角度也等于DBA,ABC的角度。 但CBE,EBD的角度是两个直角;因此,角DBA,ABC也等于两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e99ec321202b99b99ed98089c3a93713b0abd6c1352a50081c444691c0e1af7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线至他直线上所作两角，非直角、即等于两直角。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线与另一条直线相交时形成的两个相邻角，要么都是直角，要么它们的和等于两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81a341132d6b93c7ae550911a325ec34d9aadc0002f27b833ab477990c39e191","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试于乙上作垂线为戊乙〈本篇十一〉令戊乙丙与戊乙丁为两直角即甲乙丁甲乙戊两锐角并之与戊乙丁直角等矣次于甲乙丁甲乙戊两锐角又加戊乙丙一直角并此三角定与戊乙丙戊乙丁两直角等也〈公论十八〉次于甲乙戊又加戊乙丙并此锐直两角定与甲乙丙钝角等也次于甲乙戊戊乙丙锐直两角又加甲乙丁锐角并此三角定与甲乙丁甲乙丙锐钝两角等也夫甲乙丁甲乙戊戊乙丙三角既与两直角等则甲乙丁与甲乙丙两角定与两直角等〈公论一〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：在 乙 戊乙〈本篇十一〉 上作一条垂线。设 戊乙丙 和 戊乙丁 为两个直角，即 甲乙丁甲乙戊 的两个锐角等于 戊乙丁 的两个锐角。接下来，甲乙丁甲乙戊 有两个锐角，加上 戊乙丙，这个三角形等于 戊乙丙戊乙丁 的两个直角。〈公论十八〉 在 甲乙戊 旁边，然后加入 戊乙丙，它等于 甲乙丙 的两个钝角。接着在 甲乙戊戊乙丙 旁边，加上两个锐直角再加 甲乙丁，这个三角形等于 甲乙丁甲乙丙 的两个锐角和钝角。由于 甲乙丁甲乙戊戊乙丙 中的三角形等于两个直角，那么 甲乙丁 和 甲乙丙 的角也等于两个直角。〈公论一〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-13.source","contentId":"euclid-1-13","revisionId":"euclid-1-13@raw-f3afd5fd58aab462","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9ffe4c5f9b8dac7dbe5f483e10509dbb1c3928d66bf9b11bddb040687e2a5b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-13:euclid-1-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"Def. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-13:euclid-1-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-13.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"I. 11"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-14:euclid-1-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-14.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/